emies-icons/Touch of Benevolence.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of the Sanguinarch of Vampires' more elaborate creations, flexible and difficult to defeat. According to rumors, the Sanguinarch is able to snatch the blood of other creatures, imbuing new life into it and taking it under his control. Those given new life should praise the Sanguinarch for his benevolence.","abilities":["Reborn Creation (takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage)","Units blocking it gain +1 Block (up to a maximum of +6)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":1500,"atk":380,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"padmasana_of_rebirth":{"slug":"padmasana_of_rebirth","name":"Padmasana of Rebirth","icon":"/enemies-icons/Padmasana of Rebirth.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"It has no bottom yet never leaks, ferrying passengers from all lands to greener pastures atop a bed of cerulean flames. Only the freed may board this ark.","abilities":["Loads up to 3 allied Operators upon contact. Movement speed is reduced when loaded.","Will not deduct Life Points when entering the Objective Point; loaded allied Operators cannot be placed on the field"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":500,"def":2000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_heirbearer_asv":{"slug":"sarkaz_heirbearer_asv","name":"Sarkaz Heirbearer ASV","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Heirbearer ASV.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An armored supply vehicle blessed by the Sanguinarch of Vampires. While on the battlefield, enhances Gift of the Sanguinarch and Touch of the Sanguinarch.","abilities":["While in battle, Reborn Creations have increased ATK, and their attacks will additionally deal Necrosis"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":340,"def":550,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.7}},"theresis_black_crowned_lord":{"slug":"theresis_black_crowned_lord","name":"Theresis, Black Crowned Lord","icon":"/enemies-icons/Theresis, Black Crowned Lord.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Conqueror of the land, whose pen has not marked the ceremonial deed. The responsibility that he and his sister must carry has yet to come, a fact that their crown constantly reminds them of.","abilities":["First Form","[Twins] The closer Theresis and Theresa are, the more damage they deal, and the less Arts and Physical damage they take.","[Brandish] Unleashes a sword wave in a direction after charging up, dealing Physical damage to all allied units in its path.","[Guardian] Periodically attempts to significantly restore Theresa, Black Crowned Sage's SP by launching an energy sphere, which deals massive Arts damage to the first allied unit that it collides with.","Second Form","[Gemini] The closer Theresis and Theresa are, the less Physical and Arts damage they take, and the faster Theresa, Black Crowned Sage's SP recovers.","[Reshape Will] Drains a significant amount of Objective HP after an extended duration into battle.","When your mind is Fractured, defeating Theresis, Black Crowned Lord summons several elite enemies."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":120000,"atk":1800,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.8}},"deathveil_assassin":{"slug":"deathveil_assassin","name":"Deathveil Assassin","icon":"/enemies-icons/Deathveil Assassin.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Sarkaz assassins who have abandoned their names and cut off their horns. Behind their pall is a burning fanaticism and a destined fate.","abilities":["Invisible; the next attack made after breaking Invisibility will deal increased damage.","Has Arts and Physical dodge.","Temporarily loses Invisibility, Physical dodge, and Arts dodge against a Stabilizer Chain.","Can pass through a blocking unit once when HP drops to below 50%."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":24000,"atk":1500,"def":800,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"lost_hovercraft":{"slug":"lost_hovercraft","name":"Lost Hovercraft","icon":"/enemies-icons/Lost Hovercraft.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An automated thought collector built by a lost Kazdelian empire. Despite its ability to hover for extended periods, its built-in package protection mechanism compels it to land immediately upon encountering interference.","abilities":["Low-Altitude Hovering","Steals Originium Ingots upon entering the Objective."],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":600,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"sarkaz_wither_devourer":{"slug":"sarkaz_wither_devourer","name":"Sarkaz Wither Devourer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Wither Devourer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Part of the Nachzehrer army. Devours any obstacle in its way, including the living. Anything and everything is food to it.","abilities":["When blocked for the first time, devours the blocker. DEF is greatly increased, but Movement Speed